# Strand Labs business rules

These are owner-set policies. Do not contradict or "soften" them on your own.

## Positioning: Cosmetic hair care (GHK-Cu shampoo)

- Strand Labs sells **cosmetic hair care** — currently GHK-Cu peptide shampoo
  for external use on hair and scalp.
- Do **not** claim the product diagnoses, treats, cures, or prevents any
  disease (including hair loss as a medical claim). Cosmetic framing only.
- Do **not** reintroduce research-use-only (RUO) vials, age gates, or
  "laboratory research chemical" framing unless the owner explicitly reverses
  this pivot.
- No Percival LLC / named legal entity on the storefront.

