## Returns / refunds

- **All sales are final once an order is marked as processed.** The only
  exceptions are:
  1. **Pre-processing cancellations** — full refund, no fee, before the
     order is marked processed.
  2. **Shipping-damage claims** — see below.
- After an order is marked processed, no refund is available even if the
  customer asks us to halt shipment.
- **Damage claim window: 48 hours after delivery confirmation.**
- Claim must include **photos** of outer box + product + the order number,
  emailed to `aminomarketsupport@gmail.com` (or Telegram / Discord).
- On approved damage claim: customer chooses **replacement OR refund**.
  Either resolution requires the damaged product to be returned using our
  prepaid label first.
- **Refused / RTS / undeliverable parcels:** no refund. Customer can opt
  for re-shipment to a corrected address at their expense.
- **Lost parcels:** customer files with the carrier; we help with paperwork.
- We do NOT offer change-of-mind refunds after fulfillment.
- We do NOT modify orders after submission.

## Shipping

- Standard turnaround (order to delivery) is **1&ndash;2 weeks**.
- Carriers used: **USPS** and **UPS**.
- Shipping cost is **calculated at checkout in real time**.
- **Free shipping on US domestic orders of $200 or more.**
- We ship domestically and internationally as previously documented.
- Customs duties / VAT / GST are the customer's responsibility.
- No insurance and no signature required on shipments.

## Legal entity

- Do **not** reintroduce "Percival LLC", "d/b/a Amino Market",
  "d/b/a Strand Labs", or any LLC identifier on the storefront.
- Brand identifier in all copy: **Strand Labs** (no LLC suffix).
- Footer copyright line: `© <year> Strand Labs. All rights reserved.`
- No governing-law / arbitration / Virginia portal clauses unless an actual
  entity is later registered and the owner asks for them.

## Sales tax

- We do **not** currently use Stripe Tax. Duties/taxes are the customer's
  responsibility unless we expressly collect them.

## Age gate

- **Removed.** There is no 21+ research-use gate on the storefront.

## Marketing communications

- Email and SMS marketing opt-in at account creation (pre-checked, user can
  uncheck). Opt out anytime.
- Transactional messages always send.

## Promo codes / loyalty / affiliate

- **Promo codes:** Posted publicly, applied at checkout.
- **Loyalty:** Lifetime spend $300+ → 10% off future purchases.
- **Affiliate codes:** 10% off for buyer; affiliate earns 25% of profit,
  scaling to 40% after 50+ orders and $2.5k+ processed product.
- Discounts cannot be combined unless we explicitly state otherwise.
